(5621577, 815299, 53316, '<td valign="top">This absolutely needs to be on the cover of a wonderful sci-fi novel. The colors, composition, and detail are all great, but I really think that the whole is more than the sum of the parts. The overall feel of the image is organic and at the same time, technological... as if, in that sci-fi story this would represent, some human brain has been blended in a vat with circuitry, reaching out and growing every time a synapse fires....</td>', 'This absolutely needs to be on the cover of a wonderful sci-fi novel. The colors, composition, and detail are all great, but I really think that the whole is more than the sum of the parts. The overall feel of the image is organic and at the same time, technological... as if, in that sci-fi story this would represent, some human brain has been blended in a vat with circuitry, reaching out and growing every time a synapse fires....', '2009-08-24 02:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
