(5622636, 816055, 98339, '<td valign="top">love the colors and the focus on this (could have been a touch sharper although)...but to me it isn''t macro enough...if you could have gotten in on the branch with the leading lines of the plant...that would have been excellent</td>', 'love the colors and the focus on this (could have been a touch sharper although)...but to me it isn''t macro enough...if you could have gotten in on the branch with the leading lines of the plant...that would have been excellent', '2009-08-24 23:48:05.000000', NULL, 1);
