(5622652, 815856, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO the reason I voted you down (5) is that you don''t have anything that is in super focus...you have a very good start with this picture, but to me it is to blurry</td>', 'IMO the reason I voted you down (5) is that you don''t have anything that is in super focus...you have a very good start with this picture, but to me it is to blurry', '2009-08-24 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
