(5622918, 816232, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great detail and wonderful copper, metallic color. Looks almost 3D! A very creative idea that is beautifully carried out!</td>', 'Great detail and wonderful copper, metallic color. Looks almost 3D! A very creative idea that is beautifully carried out!', '2009-08-25 09:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
