(5623009, 816220, 98339, '<td valign="top">personally if you had focused in on only your subject and had that fill the frame by itself, you would have a better example of abstract.  You have to much "dead" space in this shot for me...</td>', 'personally if you had focused in on only your subject and had that fill the frame by itself, you would have a better example of abstract.  You have to much "dead" space in this shot for me...', '2009-08-25 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
