(5623021, 816199, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, I have come back to this 2/3 times now...I like your colors they are vibrant and really pop but if you had taken the shot from a little lower prospective you would have had the edge of the bowl in sharp focus with a little bit of the OOF edge of the bowl (smaller depth, the blue space in the center of the picture is to "dead" for me, nothing going on to hold my interest) with the orange background going off into space...not sure if I am explaining this well or not...in other words you have the right elements but you needed a little different angle to really make it work better IMO (which does not count)</td>', 'ok, I have come back to this 2/3 times now...I like your colors they are vibrant and really pop but if you had taken the shot from a little lower prospective you would have had the edge of the bowl in sharp focus with a little bit of the OOF edge of the bowl (smaller depth, the blue space in the center of the picture is to "dead" for me, nothing going on to hold my interest) with the orange background going off into space...not sure if I am explaining this well or not...in other words you have the right elements but you needed a little different angle to really make it work better IMO (which does not count)', '2009-08-25 12:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
