(5623029, 815979, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO I think this is to centered for me...if you had cropped from about the center out left or right that would been alot more abstract...</td>', 'IMO I think this is to centered for me...if you had cropped from about the center out left or right that would been alot more abstract...', '2009-08-25 12:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
