(5623043, 814566, 98339, '<td valign="top">if this had been in sharper focus on the bubbles I would have scored it higher (6)...I love your colors and the depth that they add to the picture</td>', 'if this had been in sharper focus on the bubbles I would have scored it higher (6)...I love your colors and the depth that they add to the picture', '2009-08-25 12:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
