(5623048, 815474, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO I think I would have cropped out the left side of the picture and some of the right, focusing in on the center where the picture is in much sharper focus and extremely abstract in colors</td>', 'IMO I think I would have cropped out the left side of the picture and some of the right, focusing in on the center where the picture is in much sharper focus and extremely abstract in colors', '2009-08-25 12:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623056, 816245, 98339, '<td valign="top">there you are...I had seen this earlier and was looking for it...you made an impression on me with your shot...but here are a couple of my opinions...I really wish you hadn''t made this so very centered...you have all the right elements, great focus, excellent DOF and a wonderfully abstract subject...just didn''t need all the surrounding area...did I mention excellent colors as well</td>', 'there you are...I had seen this earlier and was looking for it...you made an impression on me with your shot...but here are a couple of my opinions...I really wish you hadn''t made this so very centered...you have all the right elements, great focus, excellent DOF and a wonderfully abstract subject...just didn''t need all the surrounding area...did I mention excellent colors as well', '2009-08-25 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623060, 816076, 98339, '<td valign="top">excellent idea...wouldn''t have thought of this at all...great abstract</td>', 'excellent idea...wouldn''t have thought of this at all...great abstract', '2009-08-25 12:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
