(5623066, 816060, 98339, '<td valign="top">definitely have the macro part of this...not sure about the abstract of it...but I really like this shot alot..</td>', 'definitely have the macro part of this...not sure about the abstract of it...but I really like this shot alot..', '2009-08-25 12:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
