(5623070, 815316, 98339, '<td valign="top">just want to know what this is...is it a cactus?  Really cool color...good job</td>', 'just want to know what this is...is it a cactus?  Really cool color...good job', '2009-08-25 12:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623072, 815612, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well, at first...i think your image is too dark, and for that i can''t say exactly what it is. But i think it is some kind of glass with water drops flowing down, and although is too dark, i like the light coming from the bottom, but not the harsh points at the water drops, which will probabbly be bad for a lot of voters here. The focus and the background seems nice too, but again, i think that darkness isn''t helping at all and even the border is kind of affected by it. <br/>It seems to be a good idea, the textures seems nice...just try a brighter shot next time, even if you want to create this "Black" mood.<br/>I''m sorry if i was rude in any way. It''s just my opinion.<br/>Good luck to you and keep shooting! :D</td>', 'Well, at first...i think your image is too dark, and for that i can''t say exactly what it is. But i think it is some kind of glass with water drops flowing down, and although is too dark, i like the light coming from the bottom, but not the harsh points at the water drops, which will probabbly be bad for a lot of voters here. The focus and the background seems nice too, but again, i think that darkness isn''t helping at all and even the border is kind of affected by it. It seems to be a good idea, the textures seems nice...just try a brighter shot next time, even if you want to create this "Black" mood.I''m sorry if i was rude in any way. It''s just my opinion.Good luck to you and keep shooting! :D', '2009-08-25 12:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623076, 814513, 98339, '<td valign="top">such a good idea...love the converging lines...well done</td>', 'such a good idea...love the converging lines...well done', '2009-08-25 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623077, 815956, 99981, '<td valign="top">The harsh light at the left part of the "ball" is a little distracting but the colors, focus and textures are amazing for me.<br/>I''m not sure if it''s a macro, heheh, but it''s great and it looks like one! Good job: 7</td>', 'The harsh light at the left part of the "ball" is a little distracting but the colors, focus and textures are amazing for me.I''m not sure if it''s a macro, heheh, but it''s great and it looks like one! Good job: 7', '2009-08-25 13:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623080, 816104, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the border, but i really enjoy the colors and DOF. Nice shot!</td>', 'I''m not sure about the border, but i really enjoy the colors and DOF. Nice shot!', '2009-08-25 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
