(5623100, 814666, 99981, '<td valign="top">There are 3 or 4 macro shots of insects in this challenge, your shot seems to be the best of them, but like i said at the other ones, this theme is not abstract enough for me. But i think your shot is really nice, the colors could be a little stronger and there are some grainy at the green background.<br/>Good luck to you, sorry if i was rude!</td>', 'There are 3 or 4 macro shots of insects in this challenge, your shot seems to be the best of them, but like i said at the other ones, this theme is not abstract enough for me. But i think your shot is really nice, the colors could be a little stronger and there are some grainy at the green background.Good luck to you, sorry if i was rude!', '2009-08-25 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5623101, 815841, 99981, '<td valign="top">In my opinion...<br/>Good points: Colors - great greens, nice saturatio. light - i like the luminance. macro - nice catch!<br/>Bad points: shot is OOF, there is a harsh light at "her" eyes and it''s not abstract enough for me.</td>', 'In my opinion...Good points: Colors - great greens, nice saturatio. light - i like the luminance. macro - nice catch!Bad points: shot is OOF, there is a harsh light at "her" eyes and it''s not abstract enough for me.', '2009-08-25 13:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
