(5628819, 816050, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have to pick on you a little bit, just in payment for the "eat my dust" comments in the scores thread. Do you realize your 40D with a prime lens got beat by a compact Powershot S5?<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/Nyaaa.gif'', strrpos(''//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/Nyaaa.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//webpages.charter.net/yospiff/Images/Smileys/Nyaaa.gif"/> <br/> <br/>Really, though, .013 is not much! We were pretty close the whole challenge. Good job!<br/></td>', 'I have to pick on you a little bit, just in payment for the "eat my dust" comments in the scores thread. Do you realize your 40D with a prime lens got beat by a compact Powershot S5?  Really, though, .013 is not much! We were pretty close the whole challenge. Good job!', '2009-08-31 01:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
