(5628864, 815299, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful abstrast, the colors are stunning. Congrats on the ribbon, Karen.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful abstrast, the colors are stunning. Congrats on the ribbon, Karen.', '2009-08-31 01:44:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5628871, 816181, 83313, '<td valign="top">I thought the focus was going to doom this, but it came in fairly well. I suppose my pre-challenge feedback was too doomy &amp; gloomy on this one. Everytime I think I have it figured out, I am surprised. (Of course, I did not vote on this.) Good going!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-31 00:48:44.</i></td>', 'I thought the focus was going to doom this, but it came in fairly well. I suppose my pre-challenge feedback was too doomy & gloomy on this one. Everytime I think I have it figured out, I am surprised. (Of course, I did not vote on this.) Good going!', '2009-08-31 01:48:08.000000', '2009-08-31 01:48:44.000000', 0),
(5628884, 816050, 98339, '<td valign="top">I really, really thought this would do MUCH better than mine...you have all the right elements...excellent job...</td>', 'I really, really thought this would do MUCH better than mine...you have all the right elements...excellent job...', '2009-08-31 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 0),
