(5628890, 816144, 83313, '<td valign="top">Abstracts are weird challenges. Usually my votes line up more or less with the overall palcement, but not this time. I gave this one an 8 and was surprised to see where it placed overall. Some very good photography scored very low in this challenge.</td>', 'Abstracts are weird challenges. Usually my votes line up more or less with the overall palcement, but not this time. I gave this one an 8 and was surprised to see where it placed overall. Some very good photography scored very low in this challenge.', '2009-08-31 01:53:25.000000', NULL, 0),
