(5629403, 815635, 12250, '<td valign="top">It''s a small bubble on water.  I love the look.  I will be experimenting with this medium in the future.  The lavender color was adjusted in PS by changing the hue/sat.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, Carlo!   What is this? </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-02 13:58:54.</i></td>', 'It''s a small bubble on water.  I love the look.  I will be experimenting with this medium in the future.  The lavender color was adjusted in PS by changing the hue/sat.Originally posted by LydiaToo: Congrats, Carlo!   What is this? ', '2009-08-31 12:54:05.000000', '2009-09-02 14:58:54.000000', 0),
(5629405, 815353, 53571, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 as well. I thought it was a nice shot. I think it loses something on the left side. Otherwise, a nice entry and something that you should be happy with. Don''t let trolls get you down.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 as well. I thought it was a nice shot. I think it loses something on the left side. Otherwise, a nice entry and something that you should be happy with. Don''t let trolls get you down.', '2009-08-31 12:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5629408, 814501, 53571, '<td valign="top">You commented you had no idea why this scored a four. Let me explain my logic. While this is abstract and clearly is macro, I don''t see a clear focal point. To me abstract macro does not mean "hazy". Good effort but in my opinion this is not as successful as others you have done.</td>', 'You commented you had no idea why this scored a four. Let me explain my logic. While this is abstract and clearly is macro, I don''t see a clear focal point. To me abstract macro does not mean "hazy". Good effort but in my opinion this is not as successful as others you have done.', '2009-08-31 12:56:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5629413, 815977, 22538, '<td valign="top">As abstract as abstract can be. Just colours. Great job and imaginative shot. Congratulations</td>', 'As abstract as abstract can be. Just colours. Great job and imaginative shot. Congratulations', '2009-08-31 13:01:44.000000', NULL, 0),
