(5629431, 816248, 50695, '<td valign="top">I thought of the flowers as wings. For the scenario you suggest, Phaethon might be a better fit. But of course, nobody''s heard of that poor fellow.</td>', 'I thought of the flowers as wings. For the scenario you suggest, Phaethon might be a better fit. But of course, nobody''s heard of that poor fellow.', '2009-08-31 13:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5629434, 816190, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Brat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I hope this is a picture of a woman and not a picture of a picture. 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It most certainly is an image of a woman, not an image of an image.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>In that case, change my score to a 9! lol</td>', 'Originally posted by Brat: Originally posted by posthumous: I hope this is a picture of a woman and not a picture of a picture. 7   It most certainly is an image of a woman, not an image of an image.  :)   In that case, change my score to a 9! lol', '2009-08-31 13:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
