(5629441, 816248, 8891, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I thought of the flowers as wings. For the scenario you suggest, Phaethon might be a better fit. But of course, nobody''s heard of that poor fellow. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Absolutely correct. Better read my Bullfinch''s again.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I thought of the flowers as wings. For the scenario you suggest, Phaethon might be a better fit. But of course, nobody''s heard of that poor fellow.   Absolutely correct. Better read my Bullfinch''s again.', '2009-08-31 13:41:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5629454, 814501, 36981, '<td valign="top">Hi! I thought I''d comment since you didn''t know why, and my reasons for not scoring this well are completely different than mosall''s (below).  The lack of a focal point or haziness didn''t bother me - my favorite in this challenge was a blurry mess (Apparition by inshaala).  However, this put me off because the colors and shapes.  It did seem to be food or drink, and it looked really gross to me.  Extremely unappetizing, and I didn''t want to look at it for long.<br/> <br/>Still, I wouldn''t listen to me much - my favorite scored a 4.9.</td>', 'Hi! I thought I''d comment since you didn''t know why, and my reasons for not scoring this well are completely different than mosall''s (below).  The lack of a focal point or haziness didn''t bother me - my favorite in this challenge was a blurry mess (Apparition by inshaala).  However, this put me off because the colors and shapes.  It did seem to be food or drink, and it looked really gross to me.  Extremely unappetizing, and I didn''t want to look at it for long. Still, I wouldn''t listen to me much - my favorite scored a 4.9.', '2009-08-31 13:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
