(5629599, 815977, 70128, '<td valign="top">Irene... you always surprise me with your shots.. or should I say I''m not surprised anymore!? Do you realize you are by far the BEST photographer in here? I will never get tired of congratulating you, and I greatly appreciate your patience in explaining how you achieve your shots! NO, you are not boring!!!! :)</td>', 'Irene... you always surprise me with your shots.. or should I say I''m not surprised anymore!? Do you realize you are by far the BEST photographer in here? I will never get tired of congratulating you, and I greatly appreciate your patience in explaining how you achieve your shots! NO, you are not boring!!!! :)', '2009-08-31 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5629601, 815353, 73564, '<td valign="top">I agree if it were cropped tighter to rid the white edges..it would have been more abstract..This is neat none the less. Good work</td>', 'I agree if it were cropped tighter to rid the white edges..it would have been more abstract..This is neat none the less. Good work', '2009-08-31 15:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5629606, 816148, 73564, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this isn''t a macro..but it really is compared to the size of these animals..this is definitely a macro IMO. Nice job...just probably hard for some to see how this is a macro. To each their own....Thats what makes it so "interesting" on this site!</td>', 'At first I thought this isn''t a macro..but it really is compared to the size of these animals..this is definitely a macro IMO. Nice job...just probably hard for some to see how this is a macro. To each their own....Thats what makes it so "interesting" on this site!', '2009-08-31 15:57:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5629611, 814501, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, now I see what it is...didn''t have a clue during the challenge and I took off for that...it was definitely macro and abstract but your focus was just blurry to me...sorry...but at least now you have some feed back...</td>', 'ok, now I see what it is...didn''t have a clue during the challenge and I took off for that...it was definitely macro and abstract but your focus was just blurry to me...sorry...but at least now you have some feed back...', '2009-08-31 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 0),
