(5644838, 815221, 49470, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is truly abstract for it is nothing but light. It is the out of focus reflections of the sunlight off water on the surface of a table which are somehow converging back together to form the mathematical formations seen in the photo. Very cool stuff though I didn''t do any processing besides adding a purple hue to it. <br/> <br/>To Ja-9... nothing was really in focus because there is no "object" in the picture :)</td>', 'Yes, this is truly abstract for it is nothing but light. It is the out of focus reflections of the sunlight off water on the surface of a table which are somehow converging back together to form the mathematical formations seen in the photo. Very cool stuff though I didn''t do any processing besides adding a purple hue to it.  To Ja-9... nothing was really in focus because there is no "object" in the picture :)', '2009-09-12 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
